        <mxCell id="n20_kms_summary" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECEFF1;strokeColor=#455A64;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=16;fontStyle=1;" value="6. CRYPTOGRAPHIC KEY SEPARATION (AWS KMS Customer Managed Keys per Sensitivity Tier)&#xa;• CMK #1 (Commercial Analytics &amp; SOX Finance — us-east-1/us-west-2): Encrypts Commercial S3 Bronze/Silver/Gold, Redshift, DynamoDB, SNS, Glue&#xa;• CMK #2 (TALON Export-Controlled — us-east-1/us-west-2 Only): Strict ABAC Condition (aws:PrincipalTag/isUSPerson = &#39;true&#39;); Denies Part 2 Cross-Cloud Role&#xa;• CMK #3 (Mexico Sovereign PII — mx-central-1 Only): Encrypts QRO HR/Payroll S3 &amp; Glue; Key Never Exported Outside Mexico&#xa;• CMK #4 (Security &amp; Audit Archive — Security Account): Encrypts Organization CloudTrail, Config, Macie &amp; GuardDuty Findings (7-Yr WORM)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="135" width="1920" x="510" y="1025" as="geometry" />
